1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一块嫩豆腐，切成几千根丝
One block of tofu, thousands of threads

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
细得像头发丝
Thin as strands of hair

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
刀不停，豆腐不散
The knife never stops, the tofu holds

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
这刀工，三五年练不成
This knife skill takes years

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
它叫文思豆腐
It's called Wensi tofu

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
清代扬州，一位文思和尚
Qing-era Yangzhou, a monk named Wensi

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
后来做进了满汉全席
Later served at the imperial feast

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
丝入清汤，入口即化
Threads in clear broth, melt in the mouth

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
捏、烫、吹、切——
Pinch, scald, blow, slice —

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
四道菜，四手绝活
Four dishes, four hand-crafts

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
一块豆腐几千根丝，你信吗？
1,000 threads from one block — believe it?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,500
你家乡的绝活菜，评论区见
Your hometown's craft dish? Comment below
